      <h3 class="lessons-head">Four rules the sprint paid for.</h3>
      <div class="lessons">
        <div class="lesson">
          <h3>Pilots on top performers misrepresent the full cohort.</h3>
          <p>
            Testing a new source on the 30 most visible participants gave a 17% hit rate; running the full
            698-person cohort yielded 0.7%. Pilots must sample across the roster, including low-visibility profiles.
