        <div class="lesson">
          <h3>Preserve raw records with soft deletes.</h3>
          <p>
            When a Tilda results parser mistook participation rows for projects and wrote 1,004 false records,
            pre-flight backups and soft-delete pointers (merged_into) allowed an audited rollback within the same session.
