        <div class="lesson">
          <h3>Naive batch APIs shift array indices.</h3>
          <p>
            Batch user lookups drop deleted accounts and return shorter arrays, misaligning subsequent
            profiles. I rewrote the batch scripts to return explicit (query, record) pairs.
